@startuml
title LightRAG Extraction Pipeline

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #3d4a57
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #4c5b6b
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #f7fbff
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #4c5b6b
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #eef5fb
skinparam DefaultFontName Menlo

|Entry|
start
:Entry + Setup
- call _process_extract_entities
- load prompts, tokenizer, config
- create ordered_chunks
- init session state + semaphore;

|Chunk Worker|
:Primary Chunk Attempt
- select current_doc_chunks
- run phase=primary
- Apple bypass if needed
- weak-model skip gate
- tool or cache-backed LLM path
- parse/process result
- set best_attempt = primary_attempt;

|Finalize|
if (Retry-worthy structured result?) then (yes)
  :Handoff to Enrich Pipeline
- split retry and phase=enrichment
- output may replace best_attempt;
endif

:Finalize Chunk
- use current best_attempt
- update chunk cache list
- record extracted session state
- append chunk result + progress;

|Persist|
if (Any task failed?) then (yes)
  :Failure Path
- cancel pending tasks
- raise prefixed exception;
  stop
else (no)
  :Join + Persist
- wait for chunk tasks
- return chunk_results
- merge_nodes_and_edges
- phase 1/2/3 storage updates
- persist graph, vector, and KV stores;
  stop
endif
@enduml